            <ArticleTitle>Prescribing practice of take-home analgesia for day case surgery.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1047-8, 1050-1</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Postoperative pain following day surgery is a common problem. The prescription of appropriate analgesia with clear instructions for the patient is crucial. This article examines the effect of changing prescribing practice, backed up by a patient information leaflet, on the effectiveness of take-home analgesia after day case surgery.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
